---
title: "claimTokenAllocation (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: check not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert ContractPaused
    q_check_paused --> q_check_supplied: not paused
    q_check_supplied --> q_verify_proof: tokensSupplied == true
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supply: tokens not supplied
    q_revert_supply --> [*]: revert TokensNotSupplied
    q_verify_proof --> q_check_claimed: merkleProof valid for (investor, acceptedCapital)
    q_verify_proof --> q_revert_proof: invalid Merkle proof
    q_revert_proof --> [*]: revert InvalidMerkleProof
    q_check_claimed --> q_calculate: not already claimed
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: already claimed
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimed
    q_calculate --> q_check_vesting: tokenAllocation = acceptedCapital / tokenPrice
    q_check_vesting --> q_direct_transfer: no vesting schedule
    q_check_vesting --> q_deploy_vesting: vesting schedule configured
    q_direct_transfer --> q_update_state: transfer askToken to investor
    q_deploy_vesting --> q_transfer_to_vesting: deploy vesting contract clone
    q_transfer_to_vesting --> q_store_vesting: transfer askToken to vesting contract
    q_store_vesting --> q_update_state: investorPosition.vestingContract = vestingAddr
    q_update_state --> q_emit: investorPosition.claimed = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit TokensClaimed(investor, tokenAllocation, vestingContract)

    note right of q_calculate
        INV-001: Token allocation = acceptedCapital / tokenPrice
        INV-002: Each investor can claim exactly once
        INV-003: Merkle proof must validate against published root
        INV-004: Vesting contract deployed via EIP-1167 clone if vesting configured
        INV-005: Total claimed tokens <= totalAllocatedTokens
    end note
